{"id":"cc24640a822533cd","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-berlekamp-welch-decoding.md","title":"Reed–Solomon 唯一译码的 Berlekamp–Welch 阈值","display":"thm-berlekamp-welch-decoding — Reed–Solomon 唯一译码的 Berlekamp–Welch 阈值","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-berlekamp-welch-decoding","aliases":["28-thm-berlekamp-welch-decoding"],"display":"thm-berlekamp-welch-decoding — Reed–Solomon 唯一译码的 Berlekamp–Welch 阈值","depends_on":["[[28-df-machine-resources]]","[[28-df-tm]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 19.15; §19.3","source_printed_pages":"385–386","source_pdf_pages":"411–412","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-berlekamp-welch-decoding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-berlekamp-welch-decoding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-berlekamp-welch-decoding — Reed–Solomon 唯一译码的 Berlekamp–Welch 阈值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 19.15; §19.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"385–386"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"411–412"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_A,A(z)\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_A,A(z)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>。</li>\n<li>下文有限域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\">\\(\\mathbb F\\)</span> 均带明确表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p,h)\">\\((p,h)\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 是素数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathbb F_p[Z]\">\\(h\\in\\mathbb F_p[Z]\\)</span> 是首一不可约多项式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=\\deg h\\ge1\">\\(r=\\deg h\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F=\\mathbb F_p[Z]/(h)\">\\(\\mathbb F=\\mathbb F_p[Z]/(h)\\)</span>。其元素使用唯一的次数小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的代表多项式；各系数使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,p-1\">\\(0,\\ldots,p-1\\)</span> 的剩余代表及恰 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lceil\\log_2p\\rceil\">\\(\\lceil\\log_2p\\rceil\\)</span> 位二进制码。域表示和域运算均使用这些有限系数表。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=(\\mathbb F,m,d,t,\\vec a,\\vec b)\">\\(u=(\\mathbb F,m,d,t,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\">\\(d\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\">\\(t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a,\\vec b\\in\\mathbb F^m\">\\(\\vec a,\\vec b\\in\\mathbb F^m\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{BW}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{BW}}\\)</span> 是对这些带域表示元组的固定单射二进制编码：显式记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,h,m,d,t\">\\(p,h,m,d,t\\)</span> 的自分隔二进制表，随后依次记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a,\\vec b\">\\(\\vec a,\\vec b\\)</span> 的元素系数向量。编码、解码的时间及码长均以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m+\\lceil\\log_2|\\mathbb F|\\rceil+2\">\\(m+\\lceil\\log_2|\\mathbb F|\\rceil+2\\)</span> 的固定多项式有界，不允许任意额外填充。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F[X]_{\\le d}=\\{P\\in\\mathbb F[X]:\\deg P\\le d\\}\">\\(\\mathbb F[X]_{\\le d}=\\{P\\in\\mathbb F[X]:\\deg P\\le d\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg0=-\\infty\">\\(\\deg0=-\\infty\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcode}_{\\mathbb F,d}:\\mathbb F[X]_{\\le d}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\operatorname{pcode}_{\\mathbb F,d}:\\mathbb F[X]_{\\le d}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_0,\\ldots,P_d\">\\(P_0,\\ldots,P_d\\)</span> 依序连接为上述域元素的固定长度二进制码，包含末尾零系数；因此长度恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(d+1)r\\lceil\\log_2p\\rceil\">\\((d+1)r\\lceil\\log_2p\\rceil\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Agree}_u\">\\(\\operatorname{Agree}_u\\)</span> 由下式构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\coloneqq\\left\\{(\\mathbb F,m,d,t,\\vec a,\\vec b):m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1},\\ d\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\},\\ t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\},\\ t&gt;(m+d)/2,\\ \\vec a,\\vec b\\in\\mathbb F^m,\\ \\forall i,j\\in[m]\\;(i\\ne j\\Rightarrow a_i\\ne a_j)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\coloneqq\\left\\{(\\mathbb F,m,d,t,\\vec a,\\vec b):m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1},\\ d\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\},\\ t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\},\\ t&gt;(m+d)/2,\\ \\vec a,\\vec b\\in\\mathbb F^m,\\ \\forall i,j\\in[m]\\;(i\\ne j\\Rightarrow a_i\\ne a_j)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Agree}_u(P)\\coloneqq|\\{i\\in[m]:P(a_i)=b_i\\}|\\qquad\\left(u=(\\mathbb F,m,d,t,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\in\\mathcal I,\\ P\\in\\mathbb F[X]_{\\le d}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Agree}_u(P)\\coloneqq|\\{i\\in[m]:P(a_i)=b_i\\}|\\qquad\\left(u=(\\mathbb F,m,d,t,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\in\\mathcal I,\\ P\\in\\mathbb F[X]_{\\le d}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall u=(\\mathbb F,m,d,t,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\in\\mathcal I\\quad\\left|\\{P\\in\\mathbb F[X]_{\\le d}:\\operatorname{Agree}_u(P)\\ge t\\}\\right|\\le1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall u=(\\mathbb F,m,d,t,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\in\\mathcal I\\quad\\left|\\{P\\in\\mathbb F[X]_{\\le d}:\\operatorname{Agree}_u(P)\\ge t\\}\\right|\\le1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall u=(\\mathbb F,m,d,t,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\in\\mathcal I\\quad\\left[\\operatorname{time}_A(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{BW}}(u))\\le c(m+\\lceil\\log_2|\\mathbb F|\\rceil+2)^k\\land\\forall P\\in\\mathbb F[X]_{\\le d}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Agree}_u(P)\\ge t\\Rightarrow A(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{BW}}(u))=\\operatorname{pcode}_{\\mathbb F,d}(P)\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall u=(\\mathbb F,m,d,t,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\in\\mathcal I\\quad\\left[\\operatorname{time}_A(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{BW}}(u))\\le c(m+\\lceil\\log_2|\\mathbb F|\\rceil+2)^k\\land\\forall P\\in\\mathbb F[X]_{\\le d}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Agree}_u(P)\\ge t\\Rightarrow A(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{BW}}(u))=\\operatorname{pcode}_{\\mathbb F,d}(P)\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源算法用错误定位多项式解线性方程，恢复商多项式。唯一性可本地检查：两个候选至少在 2t−m&gt;d 个互异评价点一致，故差多项式恒零。原书对 m=4d、t=3d 展开证明，一般参数留作练习；本次核对一般阈值与互异评价点条件，未完成一般算法复杂度和全部域表示细节的独立复核。仅作陈述记录，不作为已核验证明依赖。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 19.15; §19.3；印刷页 385–386；PDF 页 411–412。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathrm{TM}$ 和 $\\operatorname{time}_A,A(z)$ 见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathrm{TM}$ 和 $\\operatorname{time}_A,A(z)$ 见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{time}_A,A(z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"(p,h)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathbb F_p[Z]","display":false},{"tex":"r=\\deg h\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb F=\\mathbb F_p[Z]/(h)","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ldots,p-1","display":false},{"tex":"\\lceil\\log_2p\\rceil","display":false},{"tex":"u=(\\mathbb F,m,d,t,\\vec a,\\vec b)","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec a,\\vec b\\in\\mathbb F^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{BW}}","display":false},{"tex":"p,h,m,d,t","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec a,\\vec b","display":false},{"tex":"m+\\lceil\\log_2|\\mathbb F|\\rceil+2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb F[X]_{\\le d}=\\{P\\in\\mathbb F[X]:\\deg P\\le d\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg0=-\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcode}_{\\mathbb F,d}:\\mathbb F[X]_{\\le d}\\hookrightarrow\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"P_0,\\ldots,P_d","display":false},{"tex":"(d+1)r\\lceil\\log_2p\\rceil","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Agree}_u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I\\coloneqq\\left\\{(\\mathbb F,m,d,t,\\vec a,\\vec b):m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1},\\ d\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\},\\ t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\},\\ t>(m+d)/2,\\ \\vec a,\\vec b\\in\\mathbb F^m,\\ \\forall i,j\\in[m]\\;(i\\ne j\\Rightarrow a_i\\ne a_j)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Agree}_u(P)\\coloneqq|\\{i\\in[m]:P(a_i)=b_i\\}|\\qquad\\left(u=(\\mathbb F,m,d,t,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\in\\mathcal I,\\ P\\in\\mathbb F[X]_{\\le d}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall u=(\\mathbb F,m,d,t,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\in\\mathcal I\\quad\\left|\\{P\\in\\mathbb F[X]_{\\le d}:\\operatorname{Agree}_u(P)\\ge t\\}\\right|\\le1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists A\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall u=(\\mathbb F,m,d,t,\\vec a,\\vec b)\\in\\mathcal I\\quad\\left[\\operatorname{time}_A(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{BW}}(u))\\le c(m+\\lceil\\log_2|\\mathbb F|\\rceil+2)^k\\land\\forall P\\in\\mathbb F[X]_{\\le d}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Agree}_u(P)\\ge t\\Rightarrow A(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{BW}}(u))=\\operatorname{pcode}_{\\mathbb F,d}(P)\\right)\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":3650,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-376","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-reed-muller-code]]、[[28-thm-reed-muller-distance]]、[[28-df-list-decodable-code]]、[[28-df-local-decoder]]、[[28-thm-berlekamp-welch-decoding]]、[[28-lem-hardcore-distribution]]、[[28-df-local-list-decoder]]。"}],"outgoing":["b5d4fc2d291ce98b","1965e2b0765554c9"]}